Point Roberts sits at the tip of a peninsula below the border, right on the water.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,700
The border here follows a line agreed in a treaty.

6
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:26,700
Surveyors marked the parallel across the water and the land.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,500
So the peninsula ended up cut off from the rest of the state.

8
