Now let us talk about schools and groceries in a place like this.

9
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:43,900
Children cross international borders to attend school every single day.

10
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:48,700
Groceries, gasoline and mail all move across the same crossing.

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,500
Finally, why did nobody fix the line when they noticed the problem?

12
00:00:56,300 --> 00:01:00,800
Treaties are hard to reopen, and the residents mostly like their quiet town.
